    // (primary `ModelId.Entry` ordinal, secondary `CurrentUpgradeLevel`
    // ascending: base before upgraded — bead `sts2-rs-5aelq`) THEN
    // `UnstableShuffle` (n-1 Fisher-Yates reads off `Rng.Shuffle`). The
    // (Entry, upgraded) pre-sort matters: without it the Fisher-Yates
    // input order (and thus the take-N membership) drifts from C#. Same
    // shape as the Catastrophe port (`sts2-rs-q6bix`).
